  "description": "Ever since her life was saved by a kind, golden-haired mage, Piachel has dreamed of being reunited with him. So when she’s given an opportunity to become a “Sharing,” a partner who shares their power with a mage through intimate relationships, Piachel takes the chance in the hopes of finding him. But will she be able to find her savior among the mysterious mages of the Magic Tower? And how much does she really know about the man she wishes to devote her body and soul to?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
